---
source: crates/runtime/tests/metadata/mod.rs
expression: explain_met_last_modified_filtered
---
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                           |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: met_last_modified.id ASC NULLS LAST, met_last_modified._last_modified ASC NULLS LAST                                                                                                     |
|               |   TableScan: met_last_modified projection=[id, value, year, month, day, _last_modified], full_filters=[met_last_modified._last_modified = TimestampMicrosecond(1728538620000000, Some("UTC"))] |
| physical_plan | SortExec: expr=[id@0 ASC NULLS LAST, _last_modified@5 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[false]                                                                                           |
|               |   BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |     EmptyExec                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
